(2664, 'UNITED KINGDOM (UK)', '', 'P', 'KIRITHIKA', 'krithi186@gmail.com', '8122111836', '1986-01-22', '70', '79', '75', '67', '', '', 'yet to write ', '2024', 'Sep ', 'MBA or MSc Banking & Finance ', '2024-04-21', 'I^m 38yrs old, I finished my BTech IT ENGINEERING in 2007 with 67%.\r\nI couldn^t get into software job because of recession @ that point of time, so I had to start my career in voice process. Hence I possess >11yrs of voice process experience in both international & domestic process.\r\nI^m not in a situation to spend much, so my country of preference is Germany, Switzerland and France wherein I saw many public universities to apply for , but I dont have any idea of how to proceed. so kindly guide me through the process .\r\nfew countries are themselves open for those who are financially weak to pursue studies,I donno why people here dont wish to assist them rather pushing only private universities.\r\nwherever I enquired people referred me for UK. as I have career gap they said that UK is the only possible destination. \r\n so kindly guide me through the process & help to select a worthy course that^ll help me to build a good paying job in the future thereby paving way to settle in the country.\r\nI regret for not studying properly in my degree hence I think I^m suffering without being able to make a proper career.\r\nnow I wanna correct the same by studying further but nobody is there to help me ????\r\n@ the end its like I^m begging before someone & none is there to hear me.\r\nI^m in a very bad phase of my life, kindly help me out Bro ????', 'KIRITHIKA', '2024-04-20 02:09:47', NULL, NULL, 'NDL', NULL, NULL),
